  "description": "Model Context Protocol server for SonarQube Cloud - projects, quality gates, issues, security hotspots, measures and coverage, plus issue triage - with a deliberately small, auditable dependency tree. `dnx mcp-sonarqube` runs the Native AOT binary on Windows, Linux and macOS (x64 and Arm64 where built) and a framework-dependent build elsewhere; the same binaries are on GitHub Releases (the id differs from the product name because SonarSource holds both the SonarQube* and SonarCloud* reserved package-id prefixes on nuget.org; the installed command is still `sonarqube-mcp`).",
